WEBVTT

00:00:09,070 --> 00:00:15,470
I use silver nitrate applicators when my breast tumor bleeds a lot, but I could

00:00:15,470 --> 00:00:20,590
coconut oil are the one before I bandage it. Do you have any other suggestions?

00:00:21,630 --> 00:00:23,950
I think silver nitrate, even hydrogen peroxide,

00:00:24,670 --> 00:00:30,670
topically can be a great thing to just make sure that you don't get a secondary infection.

00:00:30,670 --> 00:00:33,790
So when you ever have an open wound, you just don't want secondary infections.

00:00:34,670 --> 00:00:41,870
So silver nitrate can be a good thing. Hydrogen peroxide can be a good thing.

00:00:43,150 --> 00:00:46,910
You could actually put some just three percent hydrogen peroxide in a little spray

00:00:46,910 --> 00:00:58,270
bottle so you could just spray it out there. That can be a good thing to do.

